.nh
.TH "PB-VERSION" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-version - Print the pb version


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb version [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Print this pb's version, the same as \fBpb --version\fR\&. With --json it prints the version and the source commit it was built from, which is what support and bug reports ask for.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for version

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb(1)\fP
